cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SBSC-1: Synthetic Bank Statement Corpus for normalization research"
message: "If you use this corpus, please cite both the corpus and the accompanying article."
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A generated corpus of 30 heterogeneous bank statement files across 15 source
  layouts and 3 synthetic issuers, yielding 1200 normalized transactions with 57
  injected defects of known type and position. Contains no real persons,
  organizations, accounts or case material. Released as the companion artefact to
  a study of reproducible normalization for financial forensic analysis.
authors:
